deploy/deploy.env

# Location history. **Never commit this.** A Timeline export or a GPS track is a
# record of where somebody has been — homes, workplaces, every night for months.
# `docs/GPS/` is where exports are dropped for the tools to read; the reader is
# in the repository and the data never is.
docs/GPS/
*.gpx
Timeline.json
